Scrolls or other means of taming or charming will work.

If you anger a shopkeeper, then pacify the shopkeeper,
he will call off the guards.  This can mean as little as a few 
zorkmids, if you can manage to steal from a shop, survive the Kops,
get right next to the shopkeeper, not die, and pay him off.

